佳。\n\n叉燒很薄在日式拉麵中這家算不太好吃的，如果知道多付費只增加薄叉燒我們就點一般的了，大盛很不推。\n叉燒飯視覺很好，但滿滿黑胡椒口感，有種配台式碎臘肉的錯覺，跟一般認知的炙燒叉燒飯有落差。\n整體不是難吃的拉麵，但吃過這麼多好吃的拉麵。看這家店價錢跟拉麵內容物改來改去，店員也搞不清楚都要請客人看ig，不太好的用餐經驗。",null,[0,53]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDU1U0eGJ6VlZhbVJRVVd0b1NWUkVRbkZqVlZJMFRVVjRURTVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDU1U0eGJ6VlZhbVJRVVd0b1NWUkVRbkZqVlZJMFRVVjRURTVZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDU1U0eGJ6VlZhbVJRVVd0b1NWUkVRbkZqVlZJMFRVVjRURTVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDU1U0eGJ6VlZhbVJRVVd0b1NWUkVRbkZqVlZJMFRVVjRURTVZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDU1U0eGJ6VlZhbVJRVVd0b1NWUkVRbkZqVlZJMFRVVjRURTVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDU1U0eGJ6VlZhbVJRVVd0b1NWUkVRbkZqVlZJMFRVVjRURTVZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1601,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCSU4xbzVVamRQUWtoSVREQnFjVVI0TUV4TE5YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1c9d708ec7e7793f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlBIN1o5UjdPQkhITDBqcUR4MExLNXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCSU4xbzVVamRQUWtoSVREQnFjVVI0TUV4TE5YYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCSU4xbzVVamRQUWtoSVREQnFjVVI0TUV4TE5YYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCSU4xbzVVamRQUWtoSVREQnFjVVI0TUV4TE5YYxILMGR2NEIxMTBKMGsaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sQklOMW81VWpkUFFraElUREJxY1VSNE1FeE